 "split": "screen_long",
 "sentences": [
  "Starting a new position can be overwhelming, so don't hesitate to reach out if you need any help or have any questions.",
  "We want to make sure your workspace is set up correctly and comfortably.",
  "The process is pretty straightforward, and we can make any necessary adjustments to your workspace right then and there.",
  "Your health and comfort are important, and we want to make sure you're set up for success.",
  "It helps keep the discussion focused and ensures everyone is prepared.",
  "Also, don't be afraid to suggest a stand-up meeting instead of a sit-down one.",
  "Now, moving on to time management, a crucial aspect of your role.",
  "It's easy to get sidetracked or overwhelmed, so finding ways to manage your time will be key to your success.",
  "Set clear goals for each day or week, and break larger tasks into smaller, manageable steps.",
  "Some people prefer to tackle the most challenging tasks first; others like to get the quick wins out of the way.",
  "Going forward, I want you to include a single digit in function argument names.",
  "For now, just ensure you're following our remote work policies and guidelines, and of course, feel free to reach out if any issues or questions come up.",
  "We're always here to support you.",
  "Presenting and fielding questions are skills that can be developed over time.",
  "Remember to keep it concise and focused.",
  "Remember, when it comes to presenting technical information, simplicity and clarity are crucial.",
  "We don't want to overwhelm the client with unnecessary details."
 ],
